cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software release and the paper below."
title: "bi-kappa-distribution-sampling: a bi-Kappa velocity loader for kinetic plasma simulations"
abstract: >-
  Header-only C++11 samplers for bi-Kappa and bi-Maxwellian velocity
  distributions, loading particles relative to an arbitrary magnetic-field
  direction for particle-in-cell and hybrid simulation initialization. The
  uncapped bi-Kappa distribution is the default target; a finite velocity bound
  is opt-in and selects a distinct conditional law, which the interface reports
  at run time. Includes a validation battery that tests an N x 3 velocity sample
  from any bi-Kappa loader.
type: software
